# =========================
# Local File Storage
# =========================
# Anchored to repo/module root (leading slash) — NOT a bare "storage/", which
# would also match any path component named "storage" anywhere in the tree,
# including the com.filesync.storage Java package. That exact bug is why
# storage-service's entire source tree was silently untracked for a long time:
# `git add` never failed or warned, it just quietly ignored every file under it.
/storage-service/storage/
/storage/
uploads/
data/
test-storage/

